<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="3.2" level="1">Agriculture, Animal Care, and Food</unit>
		<unit label="subtitle" identifier="V" level="2">Domestic Animals</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="60" level="3">Livestock and Poultry</unit>
		<unit label="article" identifier="2" level="4">Disposal of Dead Poultry</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>3.2-6029</section_number>
	<catch_line>Regulations</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Board is authorized to adopt regulations concerning the specifications of disposal pits, incinerators, composting and rendering and all other matters within the purview and scope of this article to carry out the provisions of this article.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 3-583.6; 1962, c. 157; 1966, c. 702, § 3.1-747; 1992, c. 101; 2008, c. 860.</history>
